BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T203000
DTSTAMP:20260518T152803Z
CREATED:20260518T152802Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260518T152803Z
UID:10028759-1782756000-1782765000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Alex Bazemore and Friends
DESCRIPTION:Join Alex Bazemore and Friends for a Monday night residency at French Broad River Brewery. The bluegrass/ Jamgrass group is a mash up of local Asheville “all star” musicians set to explore new musical frontiers together and melt faces. Alex and his rotating cast of local musicians play sets with ranging genres and styles influenced by everything from bluegrass to folk\, jam \, funk\, and blues. Free show\, pet and family friendly! \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/alex-bazemore-and-friends-2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2/2026-06-29/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/3748C40B-D52C-48B6-833D-BE97AA2BF4DE-e1773349369508.jpeg
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=French Broad River Brewery 101 Fairview Rd Asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=101 Fairview Rd:geo:-82.5374054,35.5662722
END:VEVENT
