SUMMARY:JLloyd Mashup
DESCRIPTION:The JLloyd MashUp explores different genres of music including Acid Jazz\, Funk\, Soul\, Afro Beat\, Reggae\, Break Beat\, and Latin. Led and curated by Jonathan Lloyd (The Fritz/Dubconscious/Cadillac Jones)\, the band is made up of some of Asheville’s busiest and hardest working musicians on the scene. \n\nMusic starts around 8:30.Going until 11:15ish.\n\n\n$10. Thank you for the support!!\nMashup Mondays every Monday at One World Brewing West with special guests and different music every week!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jlloyd-mashup/2026-06-29/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
